        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Evolves Nebby into Solgaleo when used at the Altar of the Sunne.",
      "short_effect": "Evolves Nebby into Solgaleo when used at the Altar of the Sunne.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "たいようの　でんせつポケモンに\nかんしゃの　きもちを　あらわすため\nねいろを　ささげていた　という。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "태양의 전설포켓몬에게\n감사의 마음을 표현하기 위해\n음색을 바쳤다고 한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "為了對太陽的\n傳說的寶可夢表達感激之情，\n據說會用牠來獻上美樂。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une flûte dont le timbre permettait d’exprimer\nsa reconnaissance au Pokémon légendaire\ndu soleil.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Auf dieser Flöte soll eine Melodie gespielt worden\nsein, um dem Legendären Sonnen-Pokémon Dank\nzu sagen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Flauta que se hace sonar como muestra de\ngratitud hacia el Pokémon legendario del sol.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Flauto il cui dolce suono esprime la riconoscenza\ndegli esseri umani verso il Pokémon leggendario\ndel sole.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said that the tones it produces were offered\nup as an expression of gratitude to the Legendary\nPokémon of the sun.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "太陽の　伝説ポケモンに\n感謝の　気持ちを　表すため\n音色を　捧げていた　という。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "为了对太阳的\n传说的宝可梦表达感激之情，\n据说会用它来献上美乐。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
